#: includes/class-features.php:104
msgid ""
"Output structured data on listing pages (LocalBusiness, AggregateRating, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Выводить структурированные данные на страницах объявлений (LocalBusiness, "
"AggregateRating и т. д.)."

#: includes/class-features.php:111
msgid "Open Graph + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "Open Graph + Twitter Cards"

#: includes/class-features.php:112
msgid ""
"Generate social sharing meta tags so listings preview nicely on Facebook, "
"Twitter/X, LinkedIn."
msgstr ""
"Создавайте метатеги для социальных сетей, чтобы объявления красиво "
"отображались в Facebook, Twitter/X, LinkedIn."

#: includes/class-features.php:119
msgid "Breadcrumbs"
msgstr "Хлебные крошки"

#: includes/class-features.php:120
msgid ""
"Show breadcrumb navigation on listing detail pages with BreadcrumbList "
"schema."
